# Small real GFS acceptance snapshot (2026-09-16 12 UTC, 120 h at 3-hour steps).
!public/weather/gfs-2026091612-120h-v1/
# Small real ICON-EU surface weather acceptance snapshot (2026-09-16 18 UTC, two
# frames at 3-hour steps). A weather frame is five arrays over 56,817 cells, about
# 1.25 MB, so the default 72-hour run is 30 MB and is generated locally.
!public/weather/icon-eu-weather-2026091618-3h-v1/
# Small real GFS-Wave acceptance snapshot (2026-09-16 18 UTC, 9 h at 3-hour steps).
# Wave frames carry nine variables over 121 × 101 cells, so a longer bundled run
# would be tens of megabytes; generate one locally for real use.
!public/weather/gfs-wave-2026091618-9h-v1/
# Generated tide predictions; nothing marine is bundled yet.
